{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0344_1018_p", "source_sha256": "369ff06c27a01c9bb026cd5eaa9e9a4a91f1f2c7f1a844f0607ed699d830d471", "ja": "今からか！？\n俺は別に構わないけど……風花はいいのか？", "zh": "现在就开始吗！？\n我倒是没什么意见……不过，风花没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0344_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "583f70fbbfafb44907c9469f20172b199a87351ef7de7026e39758eccc816337", "ja": "はい、大丈夫です。美奈子ちゃんのためですから……！\nよろしくお願いします、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "好的，没问题。为了美奈子嘛……！\n请多关照，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
